# Misty Rainforest: {T}, pay 1 life, sacrifice it - search for a Forest or Island card and put it onto the battlefield
# untapped. A Swamp is in the library but is not a Forest or an Island, so it is not offered (the refusal), while the
# Island is found and enters untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Misty Rainforest
